    "body": "> The latest proposal is:\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n> <link type=text/css rel=stylesheet import=foo.css>\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nTo clarify, the `type=text/css` isn't necessary (it already exists for `<link>` and will reject anything that's not `text/css` when `rel=stylesheet`).\r\n\r\n`<link rel=stylesheet import=foo.css>` is equivalent to what you listed @rniwa ",
