    "body": "> This was agendad for the 2026-09-17 meeting but we ran out of time so [ agenda+](https://github.com/whatwg/html/labels/agenda%2B) To be discussed at a triage meeting should remain. We'll hopefully discuss next week.\r\n\r\nI see this (PR 12860 Module Stylesheets Syntax) was indeed discussed at the [WHATNOT meeting on 2026-09-24](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12958#top), see [meeting notes](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12958#issuecomment-5822334692).\r\n\r\nI note that style module imports (i.e. the new `<link rel=stylesheet import=\"foo.css\">` proposal) are also mentioned in issue 12163 [specifier: URL protocol for retrofitting specifiers in places designed for URLs](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12163#top).\r\n",
