    "body": "One thing I came up with just after the TPAC session:\r\n\r\nThe `<link import>` requests must be CORS-enforced to match with existing module maps / CSS modules.\r\nSo maybe on fallback (without `import` support), we should also CORS-enforce this.\r\nSo maybe we should enforce `<link import crossorigin=anonymous>` (i.e. fail if no `crossorigin` or `crossorigin=use-credentials`).",
